timeline.body:
In principle, we could further refactor by pulling all the code below into a `ElasticsearchSecurityExceptionFactory` class that would look s.th. like this:

```java
class ElasticsearchSecurityExceptionFactory {
  private final boolean isAnonymousEnabled;
  private final boolean anonymousAuthzExceptionEnabled;
  private final AnonymousUser anonymousUser;
  private final AuthenticationFailureHandler authcFailureHandler;
  
  ElasticsearchSecurityException runAsDenied(Authentication authentication, String action) {
        ....
  }
  
  ElasticsearchSecurityException bulkItemActionDenied(
        Authentication authentication,
        String action,
        TransportRequest request,
        String resolvedIndex
    ) 

    ...
}
``` 

`denialException` and `AuthorizationDenialMessages` could be entirely encapsulated by that class.

However, that's a bigger undertaking - not sure if it's worth it.

